### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/
Accept: application/json

### Generate Single Plan by Competency Level
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/generate-by-competency-level
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "competency_level": "8.1.1",
  "topic_query": "Features of Direct Democracy in Ancient Athens",
  "grade_level": "Grade 8",
  "subject": "Civic Education"
}

### Generate Batch Unit Plans
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/generate-by-unit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "unit_query": "Grade 8 Civic Education Unit 1: Democratic Governance and Citizen Participation",
  "grade_level": "Grade 8",
  "subject": "Civic Education"
}